# Same-day CFO payment ageing escalation — CFO's FNB & Payments improvement
# plan, 14-Sep-2026: "payment requests that sit too long must escalate to the
# CFO the same day, not wait for a next-day digest."
#
# Runs hourly during the Gaborone working day and emails the CFO the moment a
# request crosses the ageing threshold (Finance-editable in the Omni admin,
# Taskboard > Taskboard settings; seeded at 3 days, the same "stale" figure the
# 09:30 payment_daily_digest already uses). Each request is escalated once —
# escalated_at is stamped after a successful send — so this never repeats
# itself hourly about the same request; the daily digest still covers
# everything else every morning.
#
# READS the payment queue and SENDS an email. It never changes a payment, and
# Omni never moves money — money leaves at FNB, authorised by the CFO himself
# with two-factor.
#
# 06:00-16:00 Gaborone (UTC+2) = 04:00-14:00 UTC, on the hour.
# Reminder: this file schedules NOTHING until infra/install-crons.sh runs on
# the box and payment-ageing-escalation is in its ENABLED list.
0 4-14 * * * root cd /opt/alpha-finance && /usr/bin/docker compose --env-file /etc/alpha-finance/.env exec -T backend python manage.py payment_ageing_escalation >> /var/log/alpha-finance/payment-ageing-escalation.log 2>&1
